 "text": "Grain Sellers - Heimerl Farms\nHeimerl Farms\nHome\nOur Farm\nHistory\nCareers\nContact\nGrain Bids\nGrain Bids\nLog In\nInterested in Selling?\nQuality ingredients, quality people, quality pork!\n-->\nContact Us\nWe offer several drop off locations for selling Corn to Heimerl Farms. If interested in selling ingredients, or if you are interested in receiving a text message or email noting current grain bids daily, please fill out the following form to be contacted. Thank You!\n* Indicates required field\nName (First, Last) *\nFirst\nLast\nAddress *\nLine 1\nLine 2\nCity\nState\nZip Code\nCountry\nPhone Number *\nEmail *\nI am interested in receiving text/email messages regularly noting grain bids? (We will be in contact with you soon to get this setup) *\nYes\nNo\nComment *\nSubmit\n|\nCurrent Grain Bids\nClick here to view current grain bids for all locations.\nTELEPHONE NUMBER\n740-967-0063\nOption 5 for Bids, Milling, and Grain Origination\nMAIN OFFICE ADDRESS\n3891 Mink St., Johnstown, OH 43031\n|\nLocation\n|\nPhysical Address and Contact Information\n​3891 Mink Rd., Johnstown, OH 43031\n​\nOffice: 740.967.0063\n​\n|\nContact Us\n|\n2021 © Copyright Heimerl Farms Ltd., All Rights Reserved. No part of this website may be reproduced, distributed, or transmitted in any form or by any means, including photocopying, recording, or other electronic or mechanical methods, without the expressed written permission from the website owner and publisher. If you inquire on the use of any materials, please fill out a feedback form stating such.\n|\nHome\nOur Farm\nHistory\nCareers\nEmployment Application\nContact\nProspective Growers\nGrain Sellers\nGrain Bids\nGrain Bids\nEmployment Application\nProspective Growers\nGrain Sellers",
